{"text": "From:Lyalls, Teresa M.\nTo: Wheeler, Janet\nce:\nBCC:\nPrimary Date: 9/30/1998 2:23:47 PM\nLast Modified Date: 1998-Sep-30 14:23:48\nLast Touched Date:\nSent Date: 1998-Sep-30 14:23:\nReceived Date: 1998-Sep-30 1\nSubject: Off-Site Meeting\n\nAttachments:\nOffsite,doc\n\nOur next R&D Senior Management Off-Site Meeting is scheduled for October 22nd ...\nguess we need to start pulling an agenda together .. here's the agenda for the meeting\nheld in August...\n\nThave reserved Seminar Room O and I'm looking for a substitute room, in case of bad\nweather. The CR in 611-9 is not available ... so T'm checking on conference rooms in\n611-16...\n\nTl be on vacation next week (October 5-9), but it would be nice to have a \"draft\" agenda\nfor R&D Management to review at the October 13 Staff Meeting. 1 could prepare it\nbefore I eave or immediately upon my return .\n\nSLL6 6222S\n\nRUR2051774\n70001 9768",
